     "answer": "<b><u>superconductor</u></b>s [accept <b><u>superconductivity</u></b>; accept Type I <b><u>superconductor</u></b>s or Type II <b><u>superconductor</u></b>s] (Xi denotes the superconducting coherence length.)",
